#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd-results.rst:2
msgid "SQD result fields"
msgstr "SQD 结果字段"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd-results.rst:4
msgid ""
"The following 40 names match the ``sqd.result.v1`` contract. JSON preserves these names and uses "
"``null`` for Python ``None``. Every absent top-level value requires a ``null_reasons`` entry. "
"Required metadata is not omitted. Nested objects retain their own units and reasons. A consumer "
"must keep the method, tier, downgrade reason and warnings beside the reference energy."
msgstr ""
"以下 40 个名称与 ``sqd.result.v1`` 契约一致。JSON 保留这些名称，并用 ``null`` 表示 Python ``None``。每个缺失的顶层值都要求对应的 "
"``null_reasons`` 条目。必需元数据不得省略。嵌套对象保留自身单位和原因。使用方必须将方法、层级、降级原因和警告与参考能量一起保留。"

